# Goblin swordsman: actions read from a wrapping 7-wide strip (idle 0-6, walk 7-12, attack 13-20, hurt 25-27, death 49-55).
# GandalfHardcore pack (licensed to the author, not redistributable on
# its own). The world view plays IDLE, or WALK when moving, and flips
# to face the heading. Action rows beyond idle/walk bake for later use.

sheet goblin.ppm
cell 72 80

bank GOBLIN
seq IDLE   loop ticks=4 : lin 0-6
seq WALK   loop ticks=2 : lin 7-12
seq ATTACK once ticks=2 : lin 13-20
seq HURT   once ticks=3 : lin 25-27
seq DEATH  once ticks=3 : lin 49-55
